SCOPE OF THE PUBLIC DOMAIN DEDICATION

The dedication in UNLICENSE covers the original code and assets in this
repository.

It does not, and cannot, cover third-party material that this project merely
depends on or interoperates with — the Minecraft client, NeoForge, and
CooParticles API. Those remain under their own licences and none of their content
is redistributed in this repository.

Compile-time dependencies are resolved from public mavens at build time. No
third-party jar is committed.
